          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Emori y’etaabu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Okoir 9:6-29)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero abanto baroche ng’a Musa otebanire goika korwa ase egetunwa, bagasangererekana amo, bagachiera Aroni, bakamoteebia, “Inchuo aa, otokorere enyasae eratotang’ane, ekiagera titomanyeti eki kiamonyorire Musa, oyo otong’anyetie korwa ase ense ya Misiri.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aroni akabateebia, “Rusia ebigera bie chitaabu bire ase amato ’abakungu baino, na ase abana baino, abamura na abaiseke, mobindetere.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio abanto bonsi bakarusia ebigera bie chitaabu biare ase amato abo, bakamobiirera Aroni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere akanyora ebinto ebi korwa ase amaboko abo, akanyititora chitaabu chiria. Ekero yabwatanire, akayebomba, ekaba omogwekano bw’emori eeri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abanto bagateeba, “Abaisraeli aba, eye nero enyasae yaino, eyabang’anyetie korwa ase ense ya Misiri.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Aroni ayeroche, akaagacha egesasiimero bosio bwaye; erio akararia, akabora, “Ankio nigo rirabe Rituko Rinene ri’Omonene.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rituko ria kabere abanto bakaimoka mambia chuni, bakarua ekeng’wanso ki’ogosambwa, bakarenta na ekeng’wanso ki’omorembe. Abanto bagaikaransa, bakaria na konywa, erio bakaimoka gotenga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Omonene agateebia Musa, Tirimboka gochia inse, ekiagera abanto abwo bao kwang’anyetie korwa ase ense ya Misiri besaririe ase ogokora amabe,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "baonchokire bwango, batigire enchera eria nabachigete gotunyana, bekoreire emori eeri y’etaabu. Bayesasimire na koyeruera ekeng’wanso, bagoteeba, Abaisraeli aba, eye nero enyasae yaino, eyabang’anyetie korwa ase ense ya Misiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene agateebia Musa, “Narorire abanto aba ng’a nabanyabigoti bikong’u.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono tiga endamwamu yane yoke igoro ase bare, erinde mbasirie, erio ngokore aye obe egesaku ekenene.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Musa agasorora Omonene, Nyasae oye, akabora, “Gaaki Omonene nase ki’endamwamu yao ekoberorokera abanto bao, abakwang’anyetie korwa Misiri ase okobua okonene, na ase okoboko kwao gwe chinguru?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inee! Nigo origetie Abamisiri bateebe: Igo abarusia aa, oganetie kobaita ase ebitunwa na kobasiria kegima? Ase igo onchoka korwa ase endamwamu yao enene, tokora amabe aya kwarengereirie gokorera abanto bao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyora abasomba bao Aburaamu, na Isaka, na Israeli, na buna kwabarierete eira ase ogwetiania, okabateebia: Nigo ndamente oroiboro rwaino robe oronge buna ching’enang’eni chia igoro. Nimbae ense eye yonsi nabarierete eira ng’a nimbae ebe omwando obo kare na kare.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eri’Omonene akaonchoka, tabakorera amabe aria konya arengereirie gokorera abanto baye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa akeonchora, agatirimboka korwa ase egetunwa igoro, na ase amaboko aye obwate chibao ibere chi’amagena chiriikire oborori chinsemo chionsi ibere, bosio na magega.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chibao echio nigo chiaroisetigwe na Nyasae omonyene, na amariko aya nigo ariikire na Nyasae, amang’eire ase chibao chiria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshua akaigwa eriogi ri’abaanto bakwoga, agateebia Musa, “Naigure eriogi ase egetwori, eriogi buna eri’esegi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa akamoiraneria, “Eriogi eri tiriri eri’abaanto babuire esegi, gose eri’okorera kw’abaanto babuirwe, korende eriogi naigure neri’abaanto bagotera.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa gaikire ang’e negetwori akarora emori eria, na buna abanto baare gotenga, akaba nendamwamu enene; agaakera inse chibao chiria abwate maboko aye, chigaateka, chikaba ebisamunye ase egetunwa inse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio akabwata emori eria bakorete, akayesamba na koyesegenya goika ekaba orotu, akaroitera ase amaache ime, na akaa Abaisraeli amaache ayio, na barabwo bakanywa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agwo Musa akaboria Aroni, “Naki abanto aba bagokorete goika okagera bagakora ebibe ebinene buna ebi?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aroni akamoiraneria, “Omonene one, toba nendamwamu entindi, aye nomanyete abanto aba ng’a nababe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki nigo banteebia: Tokorere enyasae eratotang’ane, ekiagera titomanyeti eki kiamonyorire Musa, oyo otong’anyetie korwa Misiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inche: nkabateebia: Onde bwensi obwate etaabu ayerusie. Barabwo bagachirusia, bagaching’a, na inche ngachiruta ase omorero ime, na emori eye ekabao.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa akarora abanto bakoonchobana, na buna Aroni abatigete baonchobaane na gosasiima omogwekano oria, ase amasio ’ababisa babo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agwo Musa agatenena geita ki’egetwori, akabora, “Onde bwensi oyore ensemo y’Omonene ache aa ase ’nde.” Abana bonsi ba Lawi bagasangererekana asare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere akabateebia, Omonene Nyasae, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, oteebire iga “Kera oyomo oino abogorie omoyio oye o birende, agende aaria na aaria ase egetwori korwa egeita ekemo goika ekende. Kera oyomo aite onde bwensi aranyore, nonya noyomwabo, gose omosani, gose omogisangio”.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abana ba Lawi bagakora buna Musa abateebeetie, na abanto chilifu isato bagaitwa ase rituko erio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa akabateebia. “Reero inwe mweatananire ase ogokorera Omonene, kera oyomo ase rigori ria mosubati omwabo gose momura omwabo; ase ig’Omonene obasesenirie reero.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
